        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#GEN_text_vlad_dmg1</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">你到底在干什么？</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Vlad battle remarks</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">What do you think you're doing?</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#GEN_text_vlad_dmg2</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">立刻停下！
不然我将不得不使用我类似于吸血鬼的法力！[P=1]
—额，我，我依旧是个人类!</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Vlad battle remarks. He's been more damaged by the player's attacks Still pretending he's human (not a vampire)</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Cease this at once! I shall be forced to use my near-vampyric powers![P=1] -- Still human though!</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#GEN_text_vlad_dmg3</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">你最好别惹我生气，[P=1]
后果很严重。</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">"the Hulk" reference</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">You better not make me angry.[P=1] You wouldn't like me when I'm angry.</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#GEN_text_vlad_dmg4</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">如果你击败我，
我会进化成超乎你想象的强大姿态！</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Star Wars Reference</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">If you strike me down I shall become more powerful than you can possibly imagine!</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
