    <Worksheet ss:Name="POI">
      <Table>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">ID</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">zho</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Comments</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Reference texts</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#GEN_PoI_Moose01</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">这些驼鹿都是怎么了？
呃…驼鹿？羊驼鹿？</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">there are moose around the forest. Sometimes they are lying dead, having been killed by Goblins.</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">It's the king of the forest.</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#GEN_PoI_Moose02</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">它曾经是匹神兽。</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Another king of the forest.</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#GEN_PoI_Moose03</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">神兽草泥鹿？！</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Crocodile Hunter</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Crikey! What a beautiful moose!</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#GEN_PoI_Moose04</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">哦，另一只神兽。</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">just a minor joke about confusing the plural form.</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">What's up with all the mooses? Er... moose? Meese?</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#GEN_PoI_Moose05</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">真是…悲剧啊……</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
